    "text": "!main.c\n#include <stdio.h>\n\nint main(int argc, const char * argv[])\n{\n    int A1 [2] = { 10, 20 };\n    int A2 [2] = { 10, 20 };\n\n    int eq = 1;\n\n    for (int i = 0; i < 2; ++i) {\n        if (A1 [i] != A2 [i]) {\n            eq = 0;\n            break;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if (eq) {\n        printf(\"A1 == A2\\n\");\n    }\n    else {\n        printf(\"A1 != A2\\n\");\n    }\n\n    return 0;\n}\n",
